  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed extension, by reason of its depth, height, and siting on the common boundaries with numbers 108 and 112 Hoe Lane, would result in an overly dominant form of development which would result in an unneighbouly loss of light and outlook for the adjoning occupiers and an unacceptably heightened sense of enclosure. The proposal is therefore contrary to policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and policy DMD11 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
